Specifically derived (protocol surface, not source code):

  - the 音源 script contract: lx.EVENT_NAMES, lx.request, lx.on('request'),
    lx.send('inited'), lx.utils.{crypto,buffer,zlib}, response validation rules
    (URL length <= 2048, ^https?:, lyric/pic shapes)
  - the legacy musicInfo field layout produced by common/utils/tools.ts
    (toOldMusicInfo): songmid / hash / rid / strMediaMid / copyrightId / albumId
  - interaction ideas: primary + backup source fallback, a separate desktop
    lyrics window, per-platform download folders

No source file from the projects above is copied into this repository, and no
音源 scripts are distributed here — users import their own.

